This elephant didn’t just bring the trunk—it brought the whole disaster movie. The city’s exploding, a helicopter’s circling, and two little cars are still trying to find parking. Meanwhile, the elephant’s standing there like, “I said I wanted a bigger entrance—not *this* big.” And underneath it all: **LLM Chain**. Even the apocalypse has a blockchain now.
